{"id":"b04a030dde171267","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-transparency.md","title":"透明性","display":"df-transparency — 透明性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-transparency","aliases":["91-df-transparency","91-df-truth-transparency"],"display":"df-transparency — 透明性","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-ground-language]]","[[91-df-numeral]]","[[91-df-truth-theory]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-transparency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-transparency</span><span>91-df-truth-transparency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-transparency — 透明性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"024b320d234d188f\" href=\"?note=024b320d234d188f\" title=\"91-df-truth-theory\">91-df-truth-theory</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-transparency-—-透明性-$\\mathrm{Trans}$\">df-transparency — 透明性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trans}\">\\(\\mathrm{Trans}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span> (扩展语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span>-理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (允许透明替换的句子域)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transparency}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Trans}_{\\Delta}(S,T)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Delta\\,\n\\left[\nS\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transparency}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Trans}_{\\Delta}(S,T)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Delta\\,\n\\left[\nS\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trans}\">\\(\\mathrm{Trans}\\)</span> : 透明性（transparency）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Trans}_{\\Delta}(S,T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Trans}_{\\Delta}(S,T)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 在理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 中对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 透明</li>\n</ul>\n<p>透明性的含义：\n透明性必须相对于句子域<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span>说明。取<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\Delta=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>得到安全的基础透明性；在经典逻辑下取整个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>会触发说谎者矛盾。</p>\n<p>透明性的类型：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>范围</th>\n<th>形式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>完全透明</td>\n<td>所有句子</td>\n<td>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> 的双条件均可证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基础透明</td>\n<td>仅基础语言句子</td>\n<td>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> 的双条件均可证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>受限透明</td>\n<td>指定安全句子类</td>\n<td>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\Delta\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\Delta\\)</span> 的双条件均可证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>透明性与悖论的关系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>完全透明导致悖论（说谎者）</li>\n<li>基础透明是类型化理论的特征</li>\n<li>KF 在基础语言上恢复透明性；对含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的正公式可得到哪些双条件，\n取决于所采用的 KF 公理化与公式类</li>\n</ul>\n<p>透明性在真理理论中的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>透明性是真理&quot;去引号&quot;功能的理想化</li>\n<li>不同理论追求不同程度的透明性</li>\n<li>透明性程度反映了理论的强度</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-transparency-—-透明性-$\\mathrm{Trans}$","text":"df-transparency — 透明性 $\\mathrm{Trans}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-theory","status":"resolved","id":"024b320d234d188f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ (真理谓词, see [[91-df-truth-predicate]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trans}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transparency}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Trans}_{\\Delta}(S,T)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Delta\\,\n\\left[\nS\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trans}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Trans}_{\\Delta}(S,T)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":2021,"backlinks":[{"id":"05c7f9f21bb85660","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Trans}_{D}(\\mathcal S,T)$\n(域上透明性, see [[91-df-transparency]])"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-transparency]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n